TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Hihi!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Beni görünce şaşırdın mı?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Benim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}} hakkında
o kadar güzel şey duydum ki,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
ben de taşınıp kendi gözlerimle
görmek istedim!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Söylendiği kadar güzelmiş gerçekten.
{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}Her gün ayrı keyifli.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Senin de burada olman,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} burayı daha da güzel yapıyor!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} We finally run into each other!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}How have you been?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I'm {{TAG:0005:0001:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
in case you don't remember me.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}I moved into town a while ago,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} and{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0005:}}
I've been looking forward to talking
with you!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Now that I've figured out the lay of
the land,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I hope we can spend lots
of time together.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Aaa!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sonunda karşılaştık!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Nasılsın?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ben {{TAG:0005:0001:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
hatırlamadıysan diye söylüyorum.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Bir süre
önce kasabaya taşındım,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ve{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0005:}}
seninle konuşmayı dört gözle bekliyordum!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Artık buraları iyice öğrendiğime göre,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
umarım birlikte bol bol vakit geçiririz.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Abito anch'io qui,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}ma mi viene spesso nostalgia{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
della città in cui vivevo prima.
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Quindi, mi fa tanto piacere che
anche tu sia qui, {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Come vedi,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} nel mio pied-à-terre
{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}c'è un soqquadro imperdonabile,
{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}ma prometto che sistemerò presto!{{TAG:0003:0026:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} How have you
been?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}I just moved to town,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Sadly,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I'm not done unpacking yet.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}These boxes are filled with books,
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}and they're so heavy.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I've got to work on organizing this
mess,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} but I hope you'll come back
to play when I'm done!{{TAG:0003:0026:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Aaa,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Nasılsın?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}Kasabaya yeni
taşındım,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ne yazık ki,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} kutuları açmayı hâlâ
bitiremedim.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Şu kutuların içi kitap dolu,{{TAG:0003:001B:}} ve çok ağırlar.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bu dağınıklığı toparlamam gerek,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} ama
işim bitince yine gelip benimle vakit
geçir!{{TAG:0003:0026:}}

{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Aaa, bu {{TAG:0005:0008:}} değil mi!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}}'daki yeni hayatıma daha yeni başlıyorum.
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Henüz açmadığım bir sürü kutu var,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} o
yüzden önce onlarla ilgileniyorum.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Neyse,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} seni görmek her zaman güzel.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
İstediğin zaman uğrayıp sohbet et!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0005:}}You came to play!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I haven't been living in {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
for long,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}And what a relief it is to finally
have everything unpacked.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0005:}}I hope
you come by my place often!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Did you come all this way just to
say hi to me,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}It's me, {{TAG:0005:0001:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}} You haven't
forgotten me, have you?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} I live here
in town now.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Well,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} now that we're neighbors,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
I hope you come over to chat a lot.{{TAG:0003:0026:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bist du extra gekommen, nur um
mir Hallo zu sagen, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ich bin's, {{TAG:0005:0001:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Du hast mich
doch nicht etwa vergessen, oder?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich bin erst neulich hergezogen.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich hoffe, du kommst recht oft
auf einen Sprung vorbei!{{TAG:0003:0026:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sırf bana selam vermek için mi ta
buraya geldin,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Benim,
{{TAG:0005:0001:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}} Beni unutmadın, değil mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
