EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Remember me, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}It's {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I moved to
{{TAG:0005:0005:}} a while ago.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}It's great to see you again after
such a long time.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Will you please tell everyone back
