FR:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Salut, {{TAG:0005:0008:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Tu me replaces ?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Mais si : {{TAG:0005:0001:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Je me suis
